    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><br>The world is slowly being corrupted by an unknown entity. We will send you to quarantine zone to find the source and stop it from spreading.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Dozens of guns you can customize<br></li><li> Customize your character with different abilities and upgrades<br></li><li> Large world to explore with bunch of different biomes<br></li><li> Unique enemies to encounter with bossfights<br></li><li> Defeat your enemies with your friends or battle against each other</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><br>The world is slowly being corrupted by an unknown entity. We will send you to quarantine zone to find the source and stop it from spreading.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Dozens of guns you can customize<br></li><li> Customize your character with different abilities and upgrades<br></li><li> Large world to explore with bunch of different biomes<br></li><li> Unique enemies to encounter with bossfights<br></li><li> Defeat your enemies with your friends or battle against each other</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A top-down retro rogue-like. Explore a world that is slowly being corrupted by an unknown entity. Play solo or up to 4-players. Pick a class and discover, collect and modify dozens of different guns, abilities and upgrades. Find the source of Corruption and stop it from spreading.",
